join ShowerbathSP4@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons ShowerbathSP3@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons UpperOxbowSP1@Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons WetWaySP1@Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons WetWaySP2@Swildons
join ButcombeChamberSP1@ButcombeOxbows.Swildons UpperOxbowSP2@Swildons
join OldGrottoStreamSP2@Swildons WaterChamberSP1@WaterChamber.Swildons
